### Create wallet
POST http://localhost:8080/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerName": "Felipe",
  "initialBalance": 1000
}

### Get wallet by id
GET http://localhost:8080/wallets/81386dfa-f2ce-41ca-bf57-7f2cdacb5d9a

### Create wallet - zero balance
POST http://localhost:8080/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner_id": "fb2a651b-cf82-43c2-adbf-510b0df96014",
  "initial_balance": 1000
}

### Create wallet - missing owner id (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner_id": "",
  "initial_balance": 500
}

### Get wallet - not found (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/wallets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
